{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":575,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":[{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAw"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBQ"},"children":[]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Welcome_Recruit"},"children":["Welcome Recruit"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCA"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Welcome Recruit"]}," is the opening cutscene for Tower Defense Simulator and its ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Story_Mode","title":"Story Mode"},"children":["Story"]}," mode. It happens the moment the player first joins the game since the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/V2.4.0","title":"V2.4.0"},"children":["v2.4.0"]}," update. In case of the player not having the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Badges","title":"Badges"},"children":["Badge"]}," for beating the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Tutorial","title":"Tutorial"},"children":["Tutorial"]},", they will be instantly sent to the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Boot_Camp","title":"Boot Camp"},"children":["Boot Camp"]}," mission which they have to complete. Otherwise, the player will be left in the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Main_Lobby","title":"Main Lobby"},"children":["Main Lobby"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Cutscene"},"children":["Cutscene"]},"\n",{"type":"figure","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwFw"},"children":[]},{"type":"figcaption","props":{},"children":[]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwGw"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Synopsis"},"children":["Synopsis"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The following summarizes the events shown in the cutscene."]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwHQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwHg"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Synopsis"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwIA"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The cutscene starts with the Recruit waking up in a classroom. The ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]}," mentions how the Recruit has been asleep for a while, then begins to talk about how most of the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Overworld","title":"Overworld"},"children":["Overworld"]},", which on the map seen on the monitor is displayed with red, is under zombie control. He then introduces the Recruit to the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/T.D.S._Organization","title":"T.D.S. Organization"},"children":["T.D.S. Organization"]},", informing them of their job. The cutscene ends with the Recruit going on their first mission."]},"\n"]},"\n"]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwJQ"},"children":[{"type":"h3","props":{"id":"Script"},"children":["Script"]}," \n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwJg"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwJw"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Script"]}]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwKQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwKw"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwLA"},"children":[]}]},{"type":"br","props":{},"children":[]},"\n",{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["The Recruit wakes up and looks up at the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]},"."]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": Hey, you."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": You're finally awake."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["The camera moves from a first person point of view and now points at the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]}," from the side."]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": As you already know..."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": There aren't many places left under our control."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": Everything you see in red are where the zombie infestation had taken over."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": Only a few major cities, and industrial zone remain. That's it."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": Your job, is to think stragetically, and guide our team to success."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Camera now points at the Recruit."]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": T.D.S. is the foundation of our society's defense system"]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"i","props":{},"children":["Camera quickly moves to point at the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Commander","title":"Commander"},"children":["Commander"]}," and map."]}]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Commander"]}]},": We are the only thing s